 "bio": {
  "lang": "en",
  "script": "Latn",
  "text": "Makida Arshi is both an author and a full-time nurse from Virginia. She is of Ethiopian descent and lives with her husband, Dr. Ismael Yussuf, and her three wonderful daughters Hira, Nina, and Ayah. She loves to write, as it gives her thoughts and ideas an outlet, as well as helping her to help others"
